@startuml
title WarpTalk - Virtual Audio Routing to Google Meet

autonumber

<style>
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Margin 10
  }
  box {
    Margin 10
  }
}
</style>

skinparam maxMessageSize 130

actor "Participant\n(Speaker / Listener)" as Member
participant "Physical Microphone" as PhysMic <<external system>>

box "WarpTalk Desktop Client App" #AliceBlue
boundary "PopupWidget" as PopupWidget
participant ":WebAudioEngine" as WebAudio <<boundary>>
participant ":VirtualAudioDriver\nAdapter" as VirtualDriver <<boundary>>
end box

box "AI Workers Pipeline" #LightGreen
participant ":AIWorkersPipeline\n(STT -> Translate -> TTS)" as AIPipeline <<service>>
end box

participant ":OSVirtualMicrophone" as VirtMic <<boundary>>
participant ":OSVirtualSpeaker" as VirtSpeaker <<boundary>>
participant "Physical Headphones" as PhysHeadphones <<external system>>
boundary "GoogleMeetPage" as GoogleMeetPage <<external system>>

== PHASE 1: OUTGOING TRANSLATION (MEMBER SPEAKS -> GOOGLE MEET HEARS TRANSLATION) ==

Member -> PhysMic : Speak in native language into physical microphone
activate PhysMic
PhysMic -> PopupWidget : Capture raw PCM audio stream
activate PopupWidget
deactivate PhysMic

PopupWidget -> AIPipeline : Stream audio chunks (See Flow 05 for STT, Translation & TTS Workers)
activate AIPipeline
AIPipeline --> PopupWidget : Return synthesized cloned voice audio
deactivate AIPipeline

PopupWidget -> WebAudio : Queue synthesized cloned audio buffer
activate WebAudio
WebAudio -> VirtualDriver : Redirect output buffer to Virtual Driver
activate VirtualDriver
VirtualDriver -> VirtMic : Write raw PCM stream into Virtual Microphone
activate VirtMic
VirtMic --> VirtualDriver : Acknowledged
deactivate VirtMic
VirtualDriver --> WebAudio : Stream redirected
deactivate VirtualDriver
WebAudio --> PopupWidget : Done
deactivate WebAudio
deactivate PopupWidget

GoogleMeetPage -> VirtMic : Fetch input stream from OS Virtual Mic
activate VirtMic
VirtMic --> GoogleMeetPage : Transmit cloned translated voice to Google Meet attendees
deactivate VirtMic

== PHASE 2: INCOMING TRANSLATION (GOOGLE MEET SPEAKS -> MEMBER LISTENS TRANSLATION) ==

GoogleMeetPage -> VirtSpeaker : Output external participant speech stream
activate VirtSpeaker

VirtSpeaker -> PopupWidget : Capture meeting audio stream from Virtual Speaker
activate PopupWidget
deactivate VirtSpeaker

PopupWidget -> AIPipeline : Stream audio chunks (See Flow 05 for STT, Translation & TTS Workers)
activate AIPipeline
AIPipeline --> PopupWidget : Return translated voice audio & subtitles
deactivate AIPipeline

PopupWidget -> PhysHeadphones : Play translated audio directly into Physical Headphones
activate PhysHeadphones
PhysHeadphones --> PopupWidget : Audio playing
deactivate PhysHeadphones

PopupWidget --> Member : Display real-time subtitles & play translated audio in headphones
deactivate PopupWidget

@enduml
